  "fortune.text.message0": "\"There is a creeper right behind you\"",
  "fortune.text.message1": "\"You will find diamond soon\"",
  "fortune.text.message2": "\"Herobrine is watching you\"",
  "fortune.text.message3": "\"This cookie has been past its expiration date for a long time\"",
  "fortune.text.message4": "\"You should rather eat vegetables\"",
  "fortune.text.message5": "\"Help! I'm being held prisoner in a fortune cookies factory!\"",
  "fortune.text.message6": "\"You are not a real human being, you are made of cubes and pixels\"",
  "fortune.text.message7": "\"The fortune cookie is a lie\"",
  "fortune.text.message8": "\"While you're reading this, an enderman is stealing your house block by block\"",
  "fortune.text.message9": "\"Go to the beach, craft a boat, and set off for adventure!\"",
  "fortune.text.message10": "\"One day, slimes shall rule the world\"",
  "fortune.text.message11": "\"Still eating? You have some extra cubes\"",
  "fortune.text.message12": "\"You will find an unexpected surprise if you head west\"",
  "fortune.text.message13": "\"Drop a diamond in lava and your wish will come true\"",
  "fortune.text.message14": "\"Hodor!\"",
  "fortune.text.message15": "\"When the wise man points at the obsidian, the idiot gets his wooden pickaxe\"",
  "fortune.text.message16": "\"Playing ping-pong with a ghast is a fun and dangerous game\"",
  "fortune.text.message17": "\"You are all radishes\"",
  "fortune.text.message18": "\"The next Minecraft update will fix all the bugs, I promise\"",
